        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The Closet (Transmog) system is another horizontal power system. As you unlock more skins you gain stats.This is a very longterm progression system. "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1014",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1014"],
        "kind": "group",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "block-1014-figure-085",
            "sourceIds": ["block-1014"],
            "kind": "figure",
            "figureId": "figure-085"
          },
          {
            "id": "block-1014-figure-086",
            "sourceIds": ["block-1014"],
            "kind": "figure",
            "figureId": "figure-086"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1017",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1017"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Unlocking more skins will give you an increase in a % stat relative to the skin type. For example, unlocking more weapon skins will grant you an Attack Increase % specifically for your Weapon."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1019",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1019"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The calculation: ",
            "strong": true
          },
          {
            "text": "Let’s say the Attack from my Weapon, in this case my Fists (Gauntlet), is 500. Then 6.7% would be applied to the 500 if we were to go by the image above seeing as my Fist Attack Increase from my closet is +6.7%."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-1021",
        "sourceIds": ["block-1021"],
        "kind": "formula",
        "expression": "Source formula (verbatim)",
        "explanation": [
          {
            "text": "Formula",
            "strong": true
          },
          {
            "text": "[Outfit Damage = [(Min Attack "
          },
          {
            "text": "+"
          },
          {
            "text": " Max Attack) ÷ 2] × Weapon Outfit Increase %] + Pure Attack "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
